{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23165","headline":"酬严十八郎中见示 · 白居易","name":"酬严十八郎中见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"口厌含香握厌兰，紫微青琐举头看。\n忽惊鬓後苍浪发，未得心中本分官。\n夜酌满容花色暖，秋吟切骨玉声寒。\n承明长短君应入，莫忆家江七里滩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}